        "id": 3936124937,
        "type": null,
        "body": "This is already supported: `glab milestone edit <id> --state close` closes a milestone, and `--state activate` reopens it. It works for project milestones and, with `--group`, for group milestones. It shipped in v1.77.0 via !2536 ([flag definition](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/blob/main/internal/commands/milestone/edit/edit.go#L85), [docs](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/blob/main/docs/source/milestone/edit.md)). Closing as already implemented.\n\nIf you think this should remain open or be revisited, please let us know.",
